{
  "rationale": "The plant G models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, including all sensor and motion events. The specification E enforces safe obstacle-aware exploration: forward progress is prioritized when clear, obstacle recovery uses short directed turns, move_backward is only for front-obstacle recovery, and full_rotate is a last-resort. All states are deterministic and total on uncontrollable events.",
  "strategy": [
    "Forward progress is prioritized in clear states; rotate actions are used only when obstacles are detected.",
    "move_backward and full_rotate are restricted to dedicated recovery states, with transitions returning to exploration as soon as possible."
